OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 17 OCT
OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1984FTechnicians at Thames Television
OL,7,Fwalk out on strike, blacking out the
OL,8,Fchannel. Management and the ACTT
OL,9,Ftechnicians union had been discussing
OL,10,Fimplementation of plans agreed in
OL,11,FSeptember (at the end of the previous
OL,12,Fstrike), as well as the introduction of
OL,13,Fnew technology. The union warned
OL,14,Fagainst a management-run service, as it
OL,15,Fwould be a recipe for total network
OL,16,Fdisturbance. But Thames claimed that it
OL,17,Fwould be justified due to the strike
OL,18,Fbeing unofficial.
